OL,3,GNEWSAMarshal patrols deter anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns about anti-social behaviour in
OL,7,Fcoastal towns have prompted local
OL,8,Fcouncils to pay security firms to
OL,9,Fpatrol the streets and beaches.
OL,11,FThe Looe Business Forum, which has 40
OL,12,Fmember businesses, and the town council
OL,13,Fhave spent #14,500 on town marshals,
OL,14,Fwho work from 10:00 BST to 19:00 in the
OL,15,Fsummer school holidays.
OL,17,FSaltash Town Council has paid #6,000
OL,18,Ffor the patrols along the waterside for
OL,19,Fa trial period but between 14:00 and
OL,20,F22:00.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
