OL,3,GNEWSAMarshal patrols deter anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairman of Looe Business Forum
OL,7,FPeter Friend said: "The police numbers
OL,8,Fhave been cut and we used to have a
OL,9,Fpolice station in Looe that was
OL,10,Fmanned... we're not trying to take the
OL,11,Fpower and the presence of the police
OL,12,Faway but we're trying to augment that."
